# Pokémon data / assets / Kanto boundary

Do **not** invent Pokémon data or generate replacement artwork.

- Prefer local project authoritative data and assets at runtime
- PokéAPI is upstream reference/import only where the project already uses it — no new runtime PokéAPI dependency for convenience
- Do not hotlink arbitrary third-party assets

Identity axes (keep distinct): **species · form · gender · shiny**  
Do not collapse female into form/variant.

Spelling: Poké Ball · Pokédex · Pokémon · PokéCoins (proper Unicode).

## Kanto release boundary

Player-facing scope is **#001–#151**.  
National/reference assets may exist internally — that does **not** make Johto+ playable.

Do not expose later-gen species via ordinary Pokédex, encounters, or National Dex selectors without explicit owner instruction.  
Kanto-origin alternate forms stay under their Kanto species per established rules.

## Pokédex discovery

UNSEEN → SEEN → CAUGHT (monotonic).  
Do not mark Seen from opening Pokédex, polling, page load, or admin/test rendering. Use established server encounter/catch paths. Player Pokédex remains 151 species for this release.
